{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001269","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001269"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001269","label":"叔仲（立嗣議事）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"叔仲","mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0054"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0054","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","quote":"叔仲"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"叔仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001269","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-140","person_id":"cbr-p001269","surfaces":["叔仲"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","quote":"十八年二月，文公卒。文公有二妃：長妃齊女爲哀姜，生子惡及視；次妃敬嬴，嬖愛，生子俀。俀私事襄仲，襄仲欲立之，叔仲曰不可。襄仲請齊惠公，惠公新立，欲親魯，許之。冬十月，襄仲殺子惡及視而立俀，是爲宣公。哀姜歸齊，哭而過市，曰：『天乎！襄仲爲不道，殺適立庶！』市人皆哭，魯人謂之『哀姜』。魯由此公室卑，三桓彊。"}],"rationale":"按文公以後立嗣、昭公出奔、夾谷會盟、徵百牢與魯君世系的具體事件及國別暫定異稱，後期同爵稱不與先君混同。身份、匿名指代與數位疑讀待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p057","text":"十八年二月，文公卒。文公有二妃：長妃齊女爲哀姜，生子惡及視；次妃敬嬴，嬖愛，生子俀。俀私事襄仲，襄仲欲立之，叔仲曰不可。襄仲請齊惠公，惠公新立，欲親魯，許之。冬十月，襄仲殺子惡及視而立俀，是爲宣公。哀姜歸齊，哭而過市，曰：『天乎！襄仲爲不道，殺適立庶！』市人皆哭，魯人謂之『哀姜』。魯由此公室卑，三桓彊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001250","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001250","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m057-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person